{"articleNo":"699","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=699&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"삼성직무적성검사(SSAT) 모의시험 개최 및 신청자 모집","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.03.13","hit":"16850","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">삼성직무적성검사(SSAT) 모의시험을 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">아래와 같이</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">시행하오니 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">많은 참여 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong>1. 목적&nbsp;</strong><br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 가. SSAT 유형분석, 각 영역별 개인성적 분석, 추가학습 지도<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 2009 상반기 삼성그룹 지원자의 취업 경쟁력 확보&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br><strong>2. 지원자격<br></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 가. 2009년 삼성그룹 상반기 입사지원자 및 입사지원 예정자<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp; &nbsp;나. 시험당일 현재, 전학년평점 3.5 이상자로 TOEIC 700점 이상자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <font color=\"#0000ff\">(전학년평점 3.3 이상 및 TOEIC 620점 이상자는 후보등록 가능함)</font>&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span><br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong>3. 모의시험 일시/장소 </strong>: 2009년 3월 18일(수) 18:00 글로벌관 시청각실<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br><strong>4. 접&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 수</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 접수마감 : 2009. 3. 17(화) 오후 5시까지 취업정보센터<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 접수방법 : 전화접수(054-478-7211~2), 방문접수 모두가능<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 3.2pt\">응시료</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"> : 전액무료 (접수하지 않은 자는 시험장 입실불가) <br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br><strong>5. 시험실시 일정&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;<!--StartFragment--> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"79\" height=\"22\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">구분</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"76\" height=\"22\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">영역</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"75\" height=\"22\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">문항수</span></p>\n            </td>\n